  "details": "1. Connect VMT tracker(s)\n\n2. Open VRChat\n\n3. Calibrate FBT from QM Launch Pad > Calibrate FBT\n\n4. Disable FBT at QM Settings > Tracking & IK > Allow Fullbody Tracking FBT\n\n5. Enable horizon adjust at QM Settings > Advanced Options > Allow Horizon Adjust\n\n6. Set standing height at QM Settings > Advanced Options > Set Standing Height\n\n7. Change avatar height at radial menu > Expressions > Quick Actions > Avatar Height or Reset Height\n\n8. You'll see the standing height is resetted",
